_717700601129842921_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=87wsc0Uv1xQQ7kNvwG62cvB&_nc_oc=AdoBvJlmBOsO-xVA-2LuSB3K6EKwtlxoq05HYpbz-X2k5AsBgz7oqG1MpIhw0V-NTI0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQR0TcrOrM7T8CKn4g4SXMwpRiisiRBVXvNl6x6tprGiNg&oe=6B0C591E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer-Cover-Image-MINI.png", "id": "1128857345307826", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/43997708_1128857348641159_7151441411599407678_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GCfL_MymQ-YQ7kNvwHhUZ9Q&_nc_oc=Adrp0j3eu1WAAwRcfoM6pDh7FDtuYr_R_1Kod-jMvMPw7N0NmrN1YzZNn8YiRDV7XPA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQT0WwqyP1jdsf0vmbrckmilMG3i6NSr8DTO1WLJNM7Khw&oe=6B0C7C0C"}, "display_name": "Squingle Mini", "keywords": ["puzzle", "MR", "puzzling", "demo", "squingle"], "long_description": "# \ud83c\udf00 Pre-order the full game to grab exclusive bonus content at launch!\n\nSquingle Mini, offers an incredible bite-sized experience of the unique Mixed Reality 3D puzzle game, Squingle. \n\nEmbark on a journey where the lines between the virtual and real worlds blur, offering endless fun and mind-bending challenges.\n\nGuide the orbs from start to finish, avoid the edges, and collect points as you navigate through glass-like mazes called \u2018Squingles.\u2019\ud83c\udf20\n\n\n# \ud83c\udf08 A VISUAL MASTERPIECE\nEach maze is a stunning, morphing, glass-like sculpture that comes to life in either Mixed Reality or a fully immersive environment, offering an unmatched visual experience in the puzzle genre.\n\n\n# \ud83e\udde9 ACCESSIBILITY\nDesigned to be accessible for a wide range of players and skill levels, with intuitive controls and hand-tracking support for seamless play, whether standing or seated.\n\n\n# \ud83d\ude0c GLOBAL LEADERBOARD\nCompete on the Squingle Mini Leaderboard! See the sum of your best times across all levels and compare them with others around the globe.\n\n \n# \ud83d\udc7b RACE YOUR GHOST\nChallenge your best times on each level to improve your leaderboard rank for endless fun!\n\n\n# \ud83c\udf00 Immerse yourself in the world of Squingle, where every twist presents a new challenge! \ud83c\udf20", "short_description": "#\ud83c\udf00 Pre-order the full game to grab exclusive bonus content at launch!\n\nSquingle Mini, offers an incredible bite-sized experience of the unique Mixed Reality 3D puzzle game, Squingle. \n\nEmbark on a journey where the lines between the virtual and real worlds blur, offering endless fun and mind-bending challenges.\n\nGuide the orbs from start to finish, avoid the edges, and collect points as you navigate through glass-like mazes called \u2018Squingles.\u2019\ud83c\udf20"}]}, "developer_name": "Dr. Benjamin Outram ", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://squingle.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VRAL Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://squingle.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "fr", "de", "it", "ja", "zh_CN", "pl"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8945234092165227"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2312009112621976"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "420305554447473"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id":